            </t>
            <t index="303" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:35,369</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:38,457</end-time>
                <translation>能想象到接下来的发展 好可怕啊</translation>
                <original>ちょっとこの先の想像がついてきて怖いんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="304" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:38,457</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:40,925</end-time>
                <translation>当不受法律保护</translation>
                <original>その法によって守られてない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="305" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:40,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:45,945</end-time>
                <translation>人权不受保护的人真的出现了</translation>
                <original>人権の守られてない人が実際に出てきちゃった</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="306" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:45,945</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:47,932</end-time>
                <translation>我们才会意识到 居然有这样一群异己</translation>
                <original>そういう人いるもんね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="307" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:47,932</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:49,540</end-time>
                <translation>会变这样的想法呢</translation>
                <original>って話になっちゃうわけじゃないですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="308" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:49,540</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:53,517</end-time>
                <translation>如果抹除他们更有益团结的话</translation>
                <original>そのほうが都合いいことでちゃうと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="309" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:53,517</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:55,695</end-time>
                <translation>那就会更进一步地以这种形式回馈</translation>
                <original>またフィードバックしていくってこと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="310" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:55,695</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:57,708</end-time>
                <translation>嗯 要说表面上的原则</translation>
                <original>まあまああの建前を言えば</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="311" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:57,708</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:00,856</end-time>
                <translation>既然欧洲提倡有普遍人权这种东西</translation>
                <original>普遍的人権がてものがある以上は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="312" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:00,856</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:03,014</end-time>
                <translation>那就还是应该由附近的某个国家</translation>
                <original>やっぱりまああのどこか近くの国が</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="313" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:03,014</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:08,486</end-time>
                <translation>来接收 作为原则来说就会变成这样</translation>
                <original>あの引き受けるべきだというふうにまあ建前としてはそうなるところなんですけれど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="314" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:08,486</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:11,241</end-time>
                <translation>但实际上 国家这个东西</translation>
                <original>実際にはあの国家というのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="315" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:11,241</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:13,824</end-time>
                <translation>是以民族为基础的</translation>
                <original>あのネーションをベースにして</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="316" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:13,824</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:16,995</end-time>
                <translation>是为了守护民族的利益</translation>
                <original>そのネーションの利益を守ろうとして</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="317" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:16,995</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:18,644</end-time>
                <translation>一路走过来的</translation>
                <original>まあやってきたわけだから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="318" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:18,644</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:23,340</end-time>
                <translation>对不属于自己民族的人</translation>
                <original>あの自分のnationとに属してない人間まで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="319" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:23,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:25,736</end-time>
                <translation>不会因为他们只是碰巧在那</translation>
                <original>たまたまその辺に居るからって言っても</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="320" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:25,736</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:27,845</end-time>
                <translation>就有义务去保护</translation>
                <original>守ってやる義理はないと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="321" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:27,845</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:32,009</end-time>
                <translation>而这种事情在第一次世界大战中</translation>
                <original>でそういうことが第一次大戦で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="322" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:32,009</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:35,206</end-time>
                <translation>就赤裸裸地暴露出来了</translation>
                <original>まあ露骨に明らかになってしまったわけですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="323" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:35,206</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:37,427</end-time>
                <translation>我觉得这和现在的难民问题</translation>
                <original>それってまさに今の難民問題とも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="324" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:37,427</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:39,521</end-time>
                <translation>是一样的吧</translation>
                <original>同じなんじゃないかなと思うんですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="325" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:39,521</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:43,180</end-time>
                <translation>现在的欧洲 那些接收</translation>
                <original>今のヨーロッパはあの受け入れ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="326" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:43,180</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:46,733</end-time>
                <translation>成为必须接收方的欧洲国家</translation>
                <original>必要の受け入れ先になっているヨーロッパの国々は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="327" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:46,733</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:50,223</end-time>
                <translation>正是曾经试图成为民族国家的国家</translation>
                <original>まさにまあ国民国家であろうとしてきたところなんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="328" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:50,223</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:53,375</end-time>
                <translation>而这些民族国家又对这些难民们</translation>
                <original>でそこにその難民の人たちを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="329" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:53,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:57,985</end-time>
                <translation>到底能接受到什么程度呢</translation>
                <original>いったいあのどこまでこの受け入れることができるのかと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="330" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:57,985</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:59,920</end-time>
                <translation>为了照顾难民</translation>
                <original>難民の世話のために</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="331" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:59,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:01,433</end-time>
                <translation>他们还会继续承担经济负担吗</translation>
                <original>経済負担をこれ以上やるのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="332" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:01,433</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:05,543</end-time>
                <translation>这样的讨论一定会出现</translation>
                <original>とそういうようなあのまあ話が必ず出てきて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="333" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:05,543</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:08,012</end-time>
                <translation>到那时 到底该优先哪一边</translation>
                <original>そのときにじゃあ一体どっち優先するのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="334" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:08,012</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:11,586</end-time>
                <translation>是普遍人权 还是说民族利益优先</translation>
                <original>と普遍的人権なのかネーションの利益があって言えば</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="335" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:11,586</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:14,310</end-time>
                <translation>国家就不得不选择民族利益了</translation>
                <original>もうこれはもうネイションの利益とらざるを得ない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="336" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:15,880</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:19,130</end-time>
                <translation>这正是欧洲各国为之苦恼的地方</translation>
                <original>そこがまさにもヨーロッパ各国はこうで悩んでいるところで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="337" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:19,130</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:20,658</end-time>
                <translation>虽然有国际机构</translation>
                <original>で国際機関もあるけれど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="338" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:20,658</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:22,680</end-time>
                <translation>但也不是说那里就能解决</translation>
                <original>そこが解決できるわけでもない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="339" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:22,680</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:23,660</end-time>
                <translation>它没有那样的力量</translation>
                <original>そこまでの力がない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="340" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:23,660</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:27,047</end-time>
                <translation>所以我们现在也还是找不到解决办法</translation>
                <original>だから解決策が今だやっぱり私見出せてないっていう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="341" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:27,047</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:30,389</end-time>
                <translation>（当下欧洲的难民问题）又会和极权主义联系起来么？</translation>
                <original>これ全体主義にまたつながっていくわけですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="342" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:30,389</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:34,196</end-time>
                <translation>二者的关键词还是同一性吧</translation>
                <original>実際にはやっぱりキーワード同一性ですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="343" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:34,196</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:39,377</end-time>
                <translation>通过强化他们自己的这种同一性</translation>
                <original>あの自分たちのこの同一性というのをこの強めることによって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="344" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:39,377</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:42,889</end-time>
                <translation>来维持作为国家的一体性</translation>
                <original>その国家としての一体性というのを保ってきた後</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="345" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:42,889</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:46,317</end-time>
                <translation>不过也有好的一面 或者说无可奈何的一面</translation>
                <original>でただこういい面っていうかまあしょうがない面もあって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="346" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:46,317</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:48,919</end-time>
                <translation>比如想要提高教育水平</translation>
                <original>例えば教育水準上げて行こうと思うと</original>
