            </t>
            <t index="349" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:55,305</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:58,929</end-time>
                <translation>对于拼上性命战斗的人来说</translation>
                <original>やっぱり命をかけて戦うような人たちにとっては</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="350" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:58,929</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:01,260</end-time>
                <translation>他们自己应该守护的东西的形象</translation>
                <original>やっぱり自分たちが守るべきもののイメージっていうのが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="351" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:01,260</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:03,744</end-time>
                <translation>必须要清晰明确才行</translation>
                <original>ちゃんと無いとやっぱりいけないと</original>
