                <start-time>00:22:05,636</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:07,505</end-time>
                <translation>为了让人们走向幸福</translation>
                <original>人を幸福にして行く</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="354" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:07,505</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:09,240</end-time>
                <translation>还有为了确保安全保障</translation>
                <original>それから安全保障を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="355" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:09,240</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:12,977</end-time>
                <translation>的确非常民族主义</translation>
                <original>あのまあ確保している上でまあ大事だったんだけれど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="356" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:12,977</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:16,752</end-time>
                <translation>但过于依赖这一点的</translation>
                <original>しかしそれにこうあの頼りすぎたせいで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="357" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:16,752</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:19,333</end-time>
                <translation>所谓的德意志性</translation>
                <original>あのドイツ性っていうのが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="358" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:19,333</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:21,180</end-time>
                <translation>逐渐超出了预期</translation>
                <original>あの予想を超えて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="359" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:21,180</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:25,488</end-time>
                <translation>越来越被要求体现在人身上</translation>
                <original>だんだんだんだんとこの人に求められるようになっていったと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="360" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:25,488</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:27,400</end-time>
                <translation>这最终的结局</translation>
                <original>それが結局のところ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="361" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:27,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:32,573</end-time>
                <translation>就抵达了欧洲文明建立的普遍人性理想的某种局限
ヨーロッパ文明が築き上げた普遍的人間性の理想のなんか限界</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="362" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:32,573</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:34,308</end-time>
                <translation>那种东西就显现出来了</translation>
                <original>そういうのが見えて来たっていう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="363" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:34,308</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:38,330</end-time>
                <translation>这对阿伦特来说大概是个打击吧</translation>
                <original>まあアーレントには多分それショックだったんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="364" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:38,348</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:40,695</end-time>
                <translation>非常 怎么说呢</translation>
                <original>すごいまあなんか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="365" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:40,695</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:44,290</end-time>
                <translation>-残忍的现实被摆在了眼前 -是啊</translation>
                <original>-見せ付けられたというかしますね　-そうね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="366" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:44,320</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:48,012</end-time>
                <translation>毕竟自己这边真的没余力了</translation>
                <original>思いもよらなかったのは自分たちのところでいっぱいだから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="367" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:48,012</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:52,383</end-time>
                <translation>所以自然会想难民也好非法移民也好 请回去吧</translation>
                <original>そのまあ難民なりまあ不法移民でもいいです帰ってくれと思うんで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="368" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:52,383</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:54,251</end-time>
                <translation>但这些人回去了的话</translation>
                <original>帰ったらこの人たちをおそらく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="369" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:54,251</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:56,622</end-time>
                <translation>恐怕得不到任何保护</translation>
                <original>何も保護されないということは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="370" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:56,622</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:59,858</end-time>
                <translation>虽然这么说有点极端</translation>
                <original>ある意味ちょっと極端な物言いだけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="371" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:59,858</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:01,023</end-time>
                <translation>就等于让他们可以去死了</translation>
                <original>死んでいいってこと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="372" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:01,995</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:06,500</end-time>
                <translation>大概在第一次世界大战后的那种状况下</translation>
                <original>まあ多分あのこういう第一次大戦後の状況とかだったら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="373" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:06,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:09,345</end-time>
                <translation>死亡的可能性的确是相当高
まああの死ぬ可能性も当然高い</translation>
                <original/>
