            </t>
            <t index="374" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:09,345</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:13,057</end-time>
                <translation>嗯嗯嗯 生命变得非常</translation>
                <original>はいはいはいとてもこう命って</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="375" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:13,057</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:17,773</end-time>
                <translation>生命变得极其轻贱</translation>
                <original>命がものすごく軽くなるって行くっていう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="376" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:17,773</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:21,242</end-time>
                <translation>嗯 在接下来的第3夜、第4夜里</translation>
                <original>うんこの先3夜4夜で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="377" time="" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:21,242</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:23,481</end-time>
                <translation>我们学到这些概念会不断练起来吧</translation>
                <original>見せつけられることにつながっていくんだろうな</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
